{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>All that opens the womb is Mine.</b> In humans, in pure animals, and in some impure ones — but this applies in different ways, and therefore it says, <b>and all your livestock you shall sanctify the males, the firstborn of ox and sheep.</b> For the firstborn of ox and sheep shall be 'sanctified' (תזכר) in the sacrificial portion called אזכרה, as it says (Numbers 18:17): אַךְ בְּכוֹר שׁוֹר אוֹ בְכוֹר כֶּשֶׂב אוֹ בְכוֹר עֵז לֹא תִפְדֶּה, קֹדֶשׁ הֵם, אֶת דָּמָם תִּזְרֹק וְאֶת חֶלְבָּם תַּקְטִיר."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {0 "Sforno puns on תזכר ('you shall sanctify' / 'shall be remembered') and אזכרה (the sacrificial 'memorial' portion), a wordplay lost in English."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:09.199796515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}